IMPD-CS — Integrated Migrant Panel Dataset, cross-sectional component
Copyright (c) 2026 Stefano Cellini, Frank van Tubergen and Matthijs Kalmijn,
Netherlands Interdisciplinary Demographic Institute (NIDI-KNAW)

This repository holds code, crosswalks and documentation. It never holds the survey data: those are the
DANS deposits listed in Surveys/Sources.txt, each under its own DANS licence, and anyone who uses them
does so under the conditions they accepted at DANS.

Two licences apply, by folder:

  code/               MIT License (below)
  crosswalks/, docs/  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0): see LICENSE-CC-BY-4.0.md
  README.md, CITATION.cff

Third-party material, not covered by either licence and kept under the terms of its producer:
  External/           classification tables and price indices from CBS and RVIG (sources in External/Sources.txt)
  crosswalks/wording.csv, wording_notes.csv, questionnaire_items.csv, questionnaire_constructed.csv,
  questionnaire_design.csv, source_labels.csv, source_values.csv
                      question wordings, answer options and value labels reproduced from the questionnaires and
                      data files of the surveys, for documentation; their rights remain with the data producers
                      (ISEO, SCP and the fieldwork agencies named in crosswalks/surveys.csv)

